姐叫上来。”“妈。这么丢脸的事我才不会做呢。”温媛与母亲一样憋气。她早就觉得，有个不能让自己在同学面前炫耀的姐姐很没用，现在温蔓既是嫁不出去又只能挑个破落户，更丢脸了。“说来说去，大嫂真是的。现在的女孩子还是大学生的时候，家里人都得安排相亲了，免得晚了嫁不出去。”“大嫂和大哥给蔓蔓起的这名字真是的，蔓蔓，听起来不和晚晚一样吗？”不止许玉娥难堪，温蔓的父亲温世轩刚好走过来听见这话，这个中年汉子的老脸一样黑了。所以说这女儿嫁不出去，外面的人都不责怪本人，矛头先对向了孩子的父母。有些父母自己忍着，有些父母平常在社会上被他人说话已经够忍耐了，回到家没法忍，怒气都发泄到了孩子上。温蔓倒霉一点，遇到的是这种喜欢回家迁怒的父母。阳台上的唧唧喳喳。温蔓和蒋衍距离远，没有听见，两人刚垫饱了肚子，在原位坐会儿歇会儿。“你的名字是——”蒋衍问。“温蔓。”温蔓道，很平常的语气。蒋衍看着她小巧的鼻梁上搁的乌大眼镜几乎垂到了嘴唇上面，她不是那种长得很漂亮的女人，鼻梁小，嘴唇小，眼睛也有点儿小，脸蛋瘦小，手指瘦长，算不上瓜子脸美人，但是，看久了会觉得顺眼和舒服，因为她的神情始终淡淡含着微笑，像是天空中的一朵云，无忧无虑。“你的名字呢？”温蔓是被他的眼神盯得有点儿不自在了，明知道他的名字还是问了一声。“蒋衍。衍是衍生的衍，行字中间加三点水那个衍。”像是担心她弄不清楚他的名字，他是拉过她一只手，在她小掌心上划着比划。温蔓属于第一次被男人用力握着手，眼皮子惊讶地微眨，想把手缩回来，又怕失礼，只得默默忍受着。“知道是哪个字了吗？”蒋衍见她低下了头，有些担心地把脸凑近点问。“知道。”温蔓趁他稍微松点力度的时候，立马缩回手，然而手上有他的余温，有他刚刚接触过的感觉，陌生的，却让她记忆深刻。他的手倒是不像他本人那么傲气，有一层厚厚的茧，能让人感受到这人长得斯文但其实很有力气。“真的知道？”温蔓忽觉他的热气快喷到了自己的脸上，不觉地抬起视角，发现他近在咫尺，正用一双盛满笑意的眼睛看着她。微揪下眉头，她迅速低下脸，并收拾东西要离开。见到她瞬变的神色，蒋衍心头讶异时，跟着起身，问：“我是不是做错了什么？”“我不知道你和多少女孩子开过这样的玩笑，但我并不习惯。”温蔓说这话时始终望着路边的花圃，不会再去看他那张迷惑了多少女孩子芳心的俊脸。长得愈好看的男人，愈是容易风流，这几乎是一条不变的定律了。蒋衍马上意识到她误会了，而且这令他很在意，前所未有的在意。于是在她要迈开脚步时，他冲到她面前，挡住她。温家的阳台上，温家人看到蒋衍把温蔓拦住的那一刻，都把眼球瞪出来了。“天啊。这破落户看上蔓蔓姐了。”“大嫂，恭喜你了。”许玉娥听众人冷嘲热讽的恭维，黑着脸转身出了阳台。“我，我不是那样的人。”蒋衍两只手手舞足蹈，又拍了拍额头，“真的，我只是觉得你是一个很好的女孩子。”温蔓怔怔地眨着眼睫毛看他此刻手足无措的模样：莫非，他不是傲气，只是不善言辞，所以干脆装深沉不说话。“哎——”蒋衍两手抱住了头，从指缝里头露出双孩子一样无辜的眼睛。温蔓看着他这个样子，忍不住，是被逗笑了，唇角微微地扬起一个弧度。这时候，许玉娥杀了过来，远远喊道：“蔓蔓，你过来！”蒋衍听到这个冰冷的高傲的并且含着愤怒的女人声音，眉宇间划过丝不悦，在温蔓要擦过自己身边时握住了她的手：“那人是谁？”感觉到他握自己的手稍微用上了劲头，温蔓些愣之后，道：“我妈。”是她妈？一点也不像！蒋衍遥远地看着许玉娥那张把什么情绪都挂在上头的脸，深深地皱起了眉宇。如此嚣扬的女人，怎么能养得出温蔓这样富有内涵的女儿？温蔓挣开他的手，低着头向母亲走过去。于是蒋衍看她走到了许玉娥那里时，应是被许玉娥劈头盖脸地骂了一顿。他心里蓦地起了躁意，从裤袋里摸出了手机打同伴的电话：“莫文洋，你想在那群猴子面前耍多久把戏？”莫文洋早把书法表演完了，趁温家人都跑到阳台上看热闹，接了他的电话，答：“随时可以走。要不是你这个蒋家大少还想演戏，我舍命陪君子——”“去你的！还不快走！”听出蒋衍的语气很不悦，莫文洋收了线后，立马向温家人告辞。“这么快啊。”温世荣当然舍不得放走乘龙快婿，陪着莫文洋到门口，还热切地揽着这小伙子的肩膀问，“今晚感觉怎么样？”“叔叔阿姨们都很好客。”莫文洋以三好学生的口吻答。这答非所问啊。温世荣正想再继续从旁敲击，莫文洋又接到蒋衍催命的电话，因此不再看任何温家人的脸色径直走了。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/dahunwanchen/3.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "003 The thrill brewed by a bowl of instant noodles \"Sister Haoxue, let me show you something interesting.\" Wang Shaohan slipped into the study and pulled Wen Haoxue out from the crowd. Mo Wenyang was still performing calligraphy in the study at this time. Being disturbed by a little kid, Wen Haoxue suppressed her temper and immediately stared after walking out of the study: \"What's the matter?\" Wang Shaohan pulled her to the balcony and pointed to the intersection: \"Look, who is sitting with whom?\" He saw the shabby man sitting next to Wen Man. , Wen Haoxue's eyes lit up, and he stroked Wang Shaohan's head: \"You boy, you have dazzling eyes, you deserve praise. Go and pull your parents out to see you.\" Wang Shaohan pouted, and reluctantly pulled Wen Haoxue out, just because he didn't want to tell the truth himself. How could Wen Haoxue not know what this kid was thinking, so she grabbed his face and said, \"Go and drag the other sisters out.\" Wang Shaohan smiled and ran into the study room. So after a minute, no female family members were watching Mo Wenyang in the study, and they all slipped to the balcony. \"It's time for Sister Manman to get married. If she doesn't get married, what will we, the younger sisters, do?\" The sisters were all talking. Although this shabby settlement is not good, with Manman's age, it would be great to have someone. The elders also think so: \"Yes. No matter how bad he is, he is still a man. A woman will eventually have to find a man to live with.\" Didn't everyone take this opportunity to ridicule? He said that his daughter was not good enough, she was a shabby shoe that no one wanted, and she was just suitable for a shabby place to live. While Xu Yu'e was choking, she grabbed her little daughter and said, \"Run down quickly and call your sister up.\" \"Mom, I won't do such a shameful thing.\" Wen Yuan was holding her breath just like her mother. She had long felt that it was useless to have a sister who couldn't let her show off in front of her classmates. Now that Wen Man couldn't get married and could only choose a poor place to live, it was even more embarrassing. \"After all, it's true, sister-in-law. When girls are still college students nowadays, family members have to arrange blind dates, so as not to get married later.\" \"It's true that sister-in-law and eldest brother gave Manman the name, Manman, doesn't it sound the same as Wanwan?\" Not only Xu Yu'e was embarrassed, Wen Man's father Wen Shixuan happened to come over and heard this, and the middle-aged man's old face turned dark. Therefore, when the daughter cannot get married, no one outside blames herself, but first targets the child's parents. Some parents tolerate it on their own, and some parents have enough tolerance for being spoken to by others in society, but they can't bear it when they get home and vent their anger on their children. Wen Man was unlucky, encountering parents who liked to go home and express their anger. Chirping on the balcony. Wen Man and Jiang Yan were far away and did not hear. They had just filled their stomachs and sat down to rest for a while. \"What's your name-\" Jiang Yan asked. \"Wen Man.\" Wen Man said in a very normal tone. Jiang Yan looked at the big black glasses on her small nose that almost hung down to her lips. She was not the kind of beautiful woman. She had a small nose, small lips, and a little small eyes. She had a thin face and long fingers. She was not a beauty with an oval face. However, after looking at her for a long time, she felt pleasing to the eye and comfortable, because her expression was always smiling lightly, like a cloud in the sky, carefree. \"Where's your name?\" Wen Man felt a little uncomfortable because of his gaze, so she asked even though she knew his name. \"Jiang Yan. Yan is derived from Yan. Add three dots of water in the middle to represent Yan.\" As if he was worried that she wouldn't be able to figure out his name, he took one of her hands and made gestures on her small palm. This was the first time that Wen Man had her hand held by a man. She blinked in surprise and wanted to retract her hand, but she was afraid of being rude, so she had to endure it silently. \"Do you know which word it is?\" Jiang Yan saw her lowering her head and asked, looking closer with some worry. \"I know.\" Wen Man immediately retracted her hand when he relaxed a little. However, there was his residual warmth on her hand, and the feeling he had just been in contact with. It was unfamiliar, but she remembered it deeply. His hands are not as arrogant as himself. They have a thick layer of calluses, which makes people feel that this man looks gentle but is actually very strong. \"Really know?\" Wen Man suddenly felt that his hot breath was about to hit her face. She raised her angle of view unconsciously and found that he was close at hand, looking at her with a pair of smiling eyes. She frowned slightly, lowered her face quickly, packed her things and left. Seeing her sudden change of expression, Jiang Yan was surprised, then stood up and asked, \"Did I do something wrong?\" \"I don't know how many girls you have made such a joke with, but I'm not used to it.\" When Wen Man said this, he always looked at the flower garden on the roadside, and would not look at his handsome face that had confused the hearts of so many girls. The better-looking a man is, the more likely he is to be romantic. This is almost an unchanging law. Jiang Yan immediately realized that she had misunderstood, and this made him very concerned, as never before. So when she was about to take steps, he rushed in front of her and blocked her. On the balcony of the Wen family, the Wen family's eyes widened when they saw Jiang Yan stopping Wen Man. \"Oh my God. This broken-down household has fallen in love with Sister Manman.\" \"Sister-in-law, congratulations.\" Xu Yu'e listened to the sarcastic compliments and turned around and walked out of the balcony with a dark face. \"I, I'm not that kind of person.\" Jiang Yan danced with his hands and patted his forehead, \"Really, I just think you are a very good girl.\" Wen Man blinked her eyelashes blankly to see how he was at a loss at this moment: Could it be that he was not arrogant, but just not good at words, so he just pretended to be deep and silent. \"Hey -\" Jiang Yan held his head in his hands, revealing his innocent eyes like a child from between his fingers. Seeing him like this, Wen Man couldn't help but was amused, and the corners of her lips raised slightly. At this time, Xu Yu'e came over and shouted from a distance: \"Man", "title_en": "Chapter 3"}